Had some fun playing with ComputerCraft recently. Got a script to mine out a contiguous blob of resources, and another one (unpublished) to follow a line and deliver items.

To keep it short, imo Lua has some strange behavior and syntax but with type hints and intellisense it's not too bad. I still prefer JS with JSDoc tho.

